      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "飲み物の販売も、きみの舞台も好評だった。\n今度は新しい飲み物を作ってみたくなってきたよ。\n素材を持ってきてくれ。次は商船の船長たちを呼ぶ。\nきみの舞と一緒に彼らに新商品のお披露目といこう。",
        "official_en": "Between the new drinks and your dancing, this\nplace is doing great! Now, I want to make some\nbeverages that appeal to the merchant captains who\ncome through town. Would you find the ingredients?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
